    "description": "Where's my phone? \r\nAre you finding your phone?\r\nYou want sometime to find your phone quickly and easily\r\nYou want to <b>Find Phone By Clap and Whistle</b>\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Welcome to the amazing <b>Find Phone By Clap and Whistle</b> application\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc4f <b>Find My Phone By Clap, Whistle</b> is a useful phone finder app, it can help you easily find lost phone by clapping your hands and whistle.\r\n\ud83d\udc4f Just turn on the app and it will detect the clapping sound or whistle sound when you can't find your phone and the app will react to the sound and start ringing, flash or vibrate.\r\n\ud83d\udc4f With AI technology, the application deserves to be the best solution to help you find your phone. what are you waiting for? Clap to find my phone now!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f With <b>Find Phone By Clap and Whistle</b>:\r\n- Respond to claps even in silent or do not disturb mode.\r\n- Reply to claps even in silent or do not disturb mode\r\n- User-friendly interface, easy to use\r\n- You can easily locate your phone by sound or flash\r\n- Clap to find the phone\r\n- Whistle to find the phone\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc4f How to use Find My Phone by Clap:\r\n\t1. Start the application\r\n\t3. Click the Activate button\r\n\t4. It will detect clapping sound when you are finding your phone.\r\n\t5. The <b>Find My Phone By Clap, Whistle</b> app will respond to your clapping and whistle sound.\r\n\t6, It will distinguish and recognize clapping sound and start to ring, flash or vibrate.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f Finding your phone around you is no longer a problem if you have this app. Now you can find your phone, just turn on <b>Find My Phone By Clap, Whistle</b> application and leave the rest on device finder!\r\nThe <b>Find Phone By Clap and Whistle</b> app helps you find your device whether you're in a crowd, in the dark, or at home, you can trigger find the lost phone by clap app with just one button. \r\n\r\nLet download <b>Find Phone By Clap and Whistle</b> to try.\r\nThank you for your trust in using the <b>Find Phone By Clap and Whistle</b> application!\r\nHave a nice day \ud83d\ude18\ud83d\ude18\ud83d\ude18",
    "descriptionHTML": "Where&#39;s my phone? <br>Are you finding your phone?<br>You want sometime to find your phone quickly and easily<br>You want to <b>Find Phone By Clap and Whistle</b><br>\ud83d\udc49 Welcome to the amazing <b>Find Phone By Clap and Whistle</b> application<br><br>\ud83d\udc4f <b>Find My Phone By Clap, Whistle</b> is a useful phone finder app, it can help you easily find lost phone by clapping your hands and whistle.<br>\ud83d\udc4f Just turn on the app and it will detect the clapping sound or whistle sound when you can&#39;t find your phone and the app will react to the sound and start ringing, flash or vibrate.<br>\ud83d\udc4f With AI technology, the application deserves to be the best solution to help you find your phone. what are you waiting for? Clap to find my phone now!<br><br>\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f With <b>Find Phone By Clap and Whistle</b>:<br>- Respond to claps even in silent or do not disturb mode.<br>- Reply to claps even in silent or do not disturb mode<br>- User-friendly interface, easy to use<br>- You can easily locate your phone by sound or flash<br>- Clap to find the phone<br>- Whistle to find the phone<br><br>\ud83d\udc4f How to use Find My Phone by Clap:<br>\t1. Start the application<br>\t3. Click the Activate button<br>\t4. It will detect clapping sound when you are finding your phone.<br>\t5. The <b>Find My Phone By Clap, Whistle</b> app will respond to your clapping and whistle sound.<br>\t6, It will distinguish and recognize clapping sound and start to ring, flash or vibrate.<br><br>\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f Finding your phone around you is no longer a problem if you have this app. Now you can find your phone, just turn on <b>Find My Phone By Clap, Whistle</b> application and leave the rest on device finder!<br>The <b>Find Phone By Clap and Whistle</b> app helps you find your device whether you&#39;re in a crowd, in the dark, or at home, you can trigger find the lost phone by clap app with just one button. <br><br>Let download <b>Find Phone By Clap and Whistle</b> to try.<br>Thank you for your trust in using the <b>Find Phone By Clap and Whistle</b> application!<br>Have a nice day \ud83d\ude18\ud83d\ude18\ud83d\ude18",
